participate.tree
├── given contract is paused
│   └── it should revert with IsPaused
└── given contract is not paused
    ├── given reentrancy attempt
    │   └── it should revert with reentrancy guard
    └── given no reentrancy
        ├── given caller is not participant
        │   └── it should revert with NotAuthorized
        └── given caller is authorized
            ├── when _amount is 0
            │   └── it should revert with NotValid
            ├── when rescue mode is active
            │   └── it should revert with RescueModeActive
            ├── when emergency sweep has been activated
            │   └── it should revert with EmergencySweepActivated
            ├── when lastProcessedEpoch is behind currentEpoch
            │   └── it should advance epoch before proceeding
            ├── when participant has insufficient TAP balance
            │   └── it should revert with ERC20 transfer error
            ├── when participant has not approved sufficient TAP
            │   └── it should revert with ERC20 allowance error
            └── when all conditions are valid
                ├── it should transfer TAP from participant to contract
                ├── it should update bucket supply
                ├── given participant has no existing position in bucket
                │   ├── it should create new participation with correct values
                │   ├── it should set lockAmount to _amount
                │   ├── it should set expiry based on bucket lock duration
                │   ├── it should set multiplier from bucket
                │   └── it should emit Participate event
                └── given participant has existing unexpired position in bucket
                    ├── it should clear votes at past expected expiration
                    ├── it should add new votes at past expected expiration
                    ├── it should increase lockAmount by _amount
                    ├── it should update expiry to new expiry
                    └── it should update lockedAt to current timestamp
                    